      "display_title": "Issue #4307: Add \"View Scheduled Tours\" Button and Modal View Ordered by Deactivation Date",
      "main_description_html": "<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-6c501b05-b993-4051-957d-5476d3e031bd.png\"><img width=\"1049\" height=\"514\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-6c501b05-b993-4051-957d-5476d3e031bd.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 514px;; aspect-ratio: 1049 / 514; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Description:</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add an action button inside the \"Schedule Tour Activation\" modal (aligned to the footer left) that opens an overview modal/drawer listing all currently scheduled virtual tours. The list must be sorted in ascending order by the deactivation date so tours with upcoming/closer deactivations appear at the top.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Related Tasks</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Branch: design/update-modal-schedule</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">UI Design</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5535895131\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4308\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4308/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4308\">#4308</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo by Developer</h2>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5